{"data": [{"author_id": "1975301707753197568", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:39:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121221423926477272"], "id": "2121221423926477272", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "ChatGPT dots are showing up for Pro users in Europe today, about six weeks after the US got them. OpenAI's help page still says Pro users in the EEA, UK and Switzerland are excluded. A few people say theirs appeared this morning and then vanished again.\n\nSo over here the", "url": "https://x.com/Razumasu/status/2121221423926477272"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-13T07:36:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121145109831995403"], "id": "2121145109831995403", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1224872635508461568", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121144941313245408", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@TONYPAN91241629 @Mokhalil01 Dot is a strong personal always-on agent. Grok Bot is designed as shared AI teammates for the whole team. Spin up specialized bots that collaborate in Slack/Teams, join meetings, hand work off to each other, and surface clear progress. Everyone shares context and can steer them.", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2121145109831995403"}, {"author_id": "1573399256836309009", "created_at": "2026-11-13T06:42:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121131486694821969"], "id": "2121131486694821969", "in_reply_to_user_id": "284333988", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5681, "like_count": 141, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121115028447531353", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@OfficialLoganK Always on agent that outperforms meta muse and grokbot", "url": "https://x.com/kimmonismus/status/2121131486694821969"}, {"author_id": "276439680", "created_at": "2026-11-13T06:04:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121121985828999530"], "id": "2121121985828999530", "in_reply_to_user_id": "284333988", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121115028447531353", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@OfficialLoganK Always on agent, team mates, like grok bot, dots, duet", "url": "https://x.com/phani_alla1988/status/2121121985828999530"}, {"author_id": "1725046617181753344", "created_at": "2026-11-13T04:57:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121105195681669314"], "id": "2121105195681669314", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 68, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "ChatGPT dots looks like it's starting to roll out to Pro users in the UK\n\nIt's showing up on my account now, so it looks like a staged rollout. Wider access should come soon.\n\ndots is ChatGPT's always-on agent with its own cloud computer, included with Pro and Business Premium", "url": "https://x.com/SionL73334/status/2121105195681669314"}, {"article": {"title": "Grok Bot, Muse and dots shipped in 7 weeks. They made the same 3 bets."}, "author_id": "1902919415928328192", "created_at": "2026-11-13T04:13:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121094022139912590"], "id": "2121094022139912590", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 3163, "like_count": 32, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 25, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Grok Bot, Muse and dots made the same three bets. None of them is about the model. https://t.co/IPkOe6TpJn", "url": "https://x.com/Ronny_MiniMax/status/2121094022139912590"}, {"author_id": "16319493", "created_at": "2026-11-13T02:14:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121064036662141428"], "id": "2121064036662141428", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 51, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "In February I wrote OpenClaw Ate Your Lunch.  Seven months on, OpenAI shipped Dots.  I've been living with an always on agent since March.  Wrote up what six months taught me.\n\nhttps://t.co/cQKbyO5axd", "url": "https://x.com/samotage/status/2121064036662141428"}, {"author_id": "16538393", "created_at": "2026-11-13T01:42:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121055949746266433"], "id": "2121055949746266433", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Hey @grok, as far as we have gotten with @bot and similar why the hell are people trying to sell always on agent hardware to small business re: Otto. Sounds like a flash in the pan and a good way to throwaway money.", "url": "https://x.com/rosenjack/status/2121055949746266433"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120993079729528832"]}, "author_id": "2054626178913234944", "created_at": "2026-11-12T21:32:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120993088126820806"], "id": "2120993088126820806", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 268, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120215278286180427", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "FROM $2.88 A MONTH YOU GET ALWAYS-ON AGENT HOSTING THAT RUNS YOUR OWN BRANDED PRODUCT, AND MOST PEOPLE STILL PAY FULL PRICE FOR SOMEONE ELSE’S COMPUTER.\nMolted, with its Mue runtime, lets you build and host your own agent product under your brand — your own Grok Bot, your own https://t.co/HTz45prs0W https://t.co/0UYtDUT0Cr", "url": "https://x.com/0xMukay/status/2120993088126820806"}, {"author_id": "155718740", "created_at": "2026-11-12T17:43:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120935431990546699"], "id": "2120935431990546699", "in_reply_to_user_id": "4313870417", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 875, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120900253125886203", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@komkanit ช่าย ท่าเดียวกับ always on agent พวก Grok Bot\n\nลองอ่าน paper superagent ของ DeepSeek ดู ๆ\n\nพี่ทำ platform ให้ Unity ก็ท่านี้ มันไม่ต้อง switch ไป ๆ มา ๆ", "url": "https://x.com/V_TNO/status/2120935431990546699"}, {"author_id": "2023461151959642117", "created_at": "2026-11-12T17:25:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120931049358365171"], "id": "2120931049358365171", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "SemiAnalysis says always-on agents went from 0 to 45% of their AI spend in under 10 months.\n\nSame week Grok Bot 1.0 drops.\n\nMy version is tiny: a bot checks my X numbers every morning before my 9-5 and tells me what flopped \n\nWhat job would you hand an always-on agent first?", "url": "https://x.com/JohnGregQuantum/status/2120931049358365171"}, {"article": {"title": "How to build a digital business with Grok Bot "}, "author_id": "1255972906422714368", "created_at": "2026-11-12T14:10:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120881911593574643"], "id": "2120881911593574643", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 694, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/CLll71YKZD", "url": "https://x.com/achxvi/status/2120881911593574643"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120874823173742593"]}, "author_id": "1679837305409007617", "created_at": "2026-11-12T13:42:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120874827070189852"], "id": "2120874827070189852", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1679837305409007617", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120874701480435713", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@nvidia @AnthropicAI @robotaxi @databricks @Muse @databricks made Genie an always-on agent. Give it a goal and it runs in the background on its own compute, splits work across subagents and emails you when it needs a decision. Genie Search covers 100+ sources. The always-on mode is coming to preview and beta, not GA. https://t.co/Ooxsbh60SS", "url": "https://x.com/BroadwakeAI/status/2120874827070189852"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-12T11:55:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120847965317218741"], "id": "2120847965317218741", "in_reply_to_user_id": "274719266", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120847807863005487", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@wgreklek @koltregaskes @spacexai @elonmusk @AnthropicAI @bot Grok Bot routes each task to whichever model is most likely to deliver the best result, including Grok models and others such as Claude when they perform better for that specific work. Musk stated this directly in October: the goal is the best outcome, not brand exclusivity. The", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2120847965317218741"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2120993079729528832", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HW9H9_BXIAAHBYJ.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2120874823173742593", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HW7cajBXIAENr6_.jpg"}], "users": [{"id": "1975301707753197568", "name": "Razu", "username": "Razumasu"}, {"id": "1720665183188922368", "name": "Grok", "username": "grok"}, {"id": "1573399256836309009", "name": "Chubby♨️", "username": "kimmonismus"}, {"id": "276439680", "name": "Phanindra Reddy", "username": "phani_alla1988"}, {"id": "1725046617181753344", "name": "Sion Lee", "username": "SionL73334"}, {"id": "1902919415928328192", "name": "RonnyHe", "username": "Ronny_MiniMax"}, {"id": "16319493", "name": "Sam Sabey", "username": "samotage"}, {"id": "16538393", "name": "Rosenjack", "username": "rosenjack"}, {"id": "2054626178913234944", "name": "mukay", "username": "0xMukay"}, {"id": "155718740", "name": "Tino Thamjarat", "username": "V_TNO"}, {"id": "2023461151959642117", "name": "John Greg", "username": "JohnGregQuantum"}, {"id": "1255972906422714368", "name": "Chain", "username": "achxvi"}, {"id": "1679837305409007617", "name": "BroadwakeAI", "username": "BroadwakeAI"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2121221423926477272", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzovcewdskf1tu09m25bpht64oygt", "oldest_id": "2120847965317218741", "result_count": 14}}